    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d23">

                <pb facs="0160" n="42" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg42"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to the
                        Chevalier de Tavera.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-02-04"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 4,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowlege the receipt
                    of the copy of Count Kalnoky’s telegram in relation to the death of the Crown
                    Prince which accompanied your note of the 2d instant, and to inform you that the
                    same has been placed in the hands of the President.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. F. Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
